<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>If I whine or tell a lie—</l><l>That is sowing WEEDS!</l><l>I would rather use good words</l><l>And sow healthy SEEDS.</l><l>When I’m grown what I’ve sown</l><l>All will see—look at me!</l><l>I have planted carefully!</l><l>Every day in every way,</l><l>We are sowing seeds!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
